      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Find A Way (Back Home)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Itâ€™s like missing a limb, Catra decides. A very painful, noticeable limb that has her screaming silently to herself in the bathroom mirror at five in the morning because she couldnâ€™t sleep &lt;em&gt;without&lt;/em&gt; that limb.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;She decides she hates it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;OR:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra suffers just like I was when I wrote this, but she gets a reunion.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
